  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIP_Governance 2024-UNDP-LAO-01002178</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the effectiveness and inclusion of public administration and services and decision-making is central to delivering the Country Programme of UNDP in Lao PDR for the period 2022-2026. This initiative will enhance public administration and decision-making in Lao PDR. Its goal is to strengthen governance through digital transformation and human rights-based approaches, with a focus on inclusivity, particularly for vulnerable groups. The project has two main outputs: developing a governance strategy to improve public services, including digitalization, and integrating cross-cutting human rights frameworks. Key strategies include building government capacity, supporting legal and regulatory frameworks, and promoting civic engagement. This effort aligns with the country&#x2019;s national development plans and international human rights commitments.</narrative>
  </description>
